---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Felt og prosjekt — Styr.ing" activeNav="field">
  <main class="field-shell">
    <section class="field-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">Styr.ing · felt og prosjekt</span><h1>Koble arbeidet<br /><em>til kostnaden.</em></h1><p>Kjørebok, vedlikehold, FDV, prosjekter og timer samles i samme arbeidsflyt som regnskapet. Du ser grunnlaget før noe går videre.</p><a href="#field-work" class="primary">Åpne feltbildet ↓</a></div><div class="field-orb"><strong id="hero-projects">—</strong><span>aktive prosjekter</span><small id="hero-hours">— timer i kø</small></div></section>
    <section class="metrics"><article><span>Aktive kjøretøy</span><strong id="m-fleet">—</strong><small>med neste kontroll</small></article><article><span>Kjørebok</span><strong id="m-trips">—</strong><small>turer i registeret</small></article><article><span>Fakturagrunnlag</span><strong id="m-wip">—</strong><small>godkjente timer i verdi</small></article><article class="dark"><span>Feltoppgaver</span><strong id="m-facilities">—</strong><small>FDV/HMS til oppfølging</small></article></section>
    <section id="field-work" class="workspace"><div class="head"><div><span class="kicker">Operativt feltregister</span><h2 id="view-title">Kjøretøy og kjørebok</h2></div><span id="status">Henter…</span></div>
      <nav class="tabs" aria-label="Feltvisninger">{[['fleet','Kjøretøy'],['trips','Kjørebok'],['maintenance','Vedlikehold'],['facilities','FDV'],['projects','Prosjekter'],['rates','Priser og margin'],['time','Timer'],['wip','WIP'],['invoice_drafts','Fakturautkast']].map(([key,label],i)=><button type="button" class={i===0?'active':''} data-view={key}>{label}</button>)}</nav><div id="list"><p class="empty">Henter rader…</p></div></section>
    <section class="actions"><div><span class="kicker">Kontrollert feltarbeid</span><h2>Flytt neste oppgave frem.</h2><p>Registrer og kontroller arbeidet her. GPS, skatteberegning og EHF-sending er ikke aktivert uten godkjente datakilder og avtaler.</p></div><div class="action-grid">
      <form id="trip-form"><strong>Klassifiser kjøretur</strong><label>Tur<select id="trip-select" name="tripId" required></select></label><label>Type<select name="tripType"><option value="business">Yrkesreise</option><option value="private">Privat</option><option value="commute">Arbeidsreise</option><option value="unknown">Uavklart</option></select></label><button type="submit">Klassifiser tur</button></form>
      <form id="maintenance-form"><strong>Fullfør vedlikehold</strong><label>Oppgave<select id="maintenance-select" name="maintenanceId" required></select></label><button type="submit">Marker fullført</button><small>Legg ved dokumentasjon og kostnad i kilden.</small></form>
      <form id="facility-form"><strong>Fullfør FDV-oppgave</strong><label>Kontrollpunkt<select id="facility-task-select" name="taskId" required></select></label><label>Dokumentasjonsreferanse<input name="evidenceRef" maxlength="500" placeholder="Lenke eller arkiv-ID (valgfritt)" /></label><button type="submit">Marker kontrollert</button><small>Oppdaterer status og kontrollspor.</small></form>
      <form id="time-entry-form"><strong>Før timer</strong><label>Prosjekt<select id="time-entry-project-select" name="projectId" required></select></label><label>Person<select id="time-entry-person-select" name="personId" required></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Dato<input type="date" name="workDate" required /></label><label>Minutter<input type="number" name="minutes" min="1" max="1440" required placeholder="60" /></label></div><label>Beskrivelse<input name="description" maxlength="500" placeholder="Hva ble gjort?" /></label><button type="submit">Lagre som utkast</button><small>Sendes til kontroll før fakturagrunnlag.</small></form>
      <form id="time-submit-form"><strong>Send timer til kontroll</strong><label>Timeføring<select id="time-draft-select" name="entryId" required></select></label><button type="submit">Send inn</button><small>Godkjenner kontrollerer før bruk.</small></form>
      <form id="invoice-form"><strong>Forbered fakturautkast</strong><label>Prosjekt<select id="project-select" name="projectId" required></select></label><label>Periode<input name="period" required placeholder="2026-08" pattern="\\d{4}-\\d{2}" /></label><button type="submit">Forbered utkast</button></form>
      <form id="time-approval-form"><strong>Godkjenn timer</strong><label>Timeføring<select id="time-select" name="entryId" required></select></label><button type="submit">Godkjenn timeføring</button><small>Oppdaterer kontrollsporet.</small></form>
      <form id="draft-approval-form"><strong>Godkjenn fakturautkast</strong><label>Utkast<select id="draft-select" name="draftId" required></select></label><button type="submit">Godkjenn utkast</button><small>Ekstern fakturering og EHF er ikke aktivert.</small></form>
      <form id="draft-convert-form"><strong>Gjør utkast til salgsfaktura</strong><label>Godkjent utkast<select id="draft-convert-select" name="draftId" required></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Fakturadato<input type="date" name="issueDate" required /></label><label>Forfall<input type="date" name="dueDate" required /></label></div><label>Fakturanummer (valgfritt)<input name="invoiceNumber" maxlength="80" placeholder="Fylles ut automatisk" /></label><label>MVA<select name="vatRate"><option value="0">0 %</option><option value="12">12 %</option><option value="15">15 %</option><option value="25" selected>25 %</option></select></label><button type="submit">Opprett fakturautkast</button><small>Oppretter et vanlig salgsfakturautkast i regnskapet. Sending og EHF krever separat oppsett.</small></form>
    </div><p id="action-status" class="action-status" role="status" hidden></p></section>
    <section class="notice"><strong>Produksjonsgrense</strong><p>Styr.ing viser grunnlaget. Eksterne innsendinger, betalinger og rapportering skjer først når leverandør, avtale, datakilde og menneskelig godkjenning er på plass.</p></section>
  </main>
</Layout>
<script is:inline>
  const esc = (v) => String(v ?? '').replace(/[&<>'"]/g, (c) => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;',"'":'&#39;','"':'&quot;'}[c]));
  const qs = (s) => document.querySelector(s); const list = qs('#list'); const status = qs('#status'); const actionStatus = qs('#action-status');
  const labels = {active:'Aktiv',draft:'Utkast',classified:'Klassifisert',approved:'Godkjent',scheduled:'Planlagt',open:'Åpen',submitted:'Innsendt',complete:'Ferdig',prepared:'Forberedt',review:'Til kontroll',business:'Yrkesreise',private:'Privat',commute:'Arbeidsreise',unknown:'Uavklart',manual:'Manuell'};
  const pill = (v) => `<em class="pill">${esc(labels[v] || v || '—')}</em>`; const money = (v) => `${new Intl.NumberFormat('nb-NO').format(Number(v || 0) / 100)} NOK`;
  const viewTitles = {fleet:'Kjøretøy og kjørebok',trips:'Kjørebok',maintenance:'Vedlikehold',facilities:'FDV-objekter',projects:'Prosjekter',rates:'Priser og margin',time:'Timer',wip:'Arbeid under utførelse',invoice_drafts:'Fakturautkast'};
  const renderers = {fleet:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.registration)} · ${esc(r.make_model)}</strong><p>${esc(r.owner_name||'Uten eier')} · ${esc(r.odometer_km||0)} km</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<small>EU-kontroll ${esc(r.next_inspection_date||'—')}</small></article>`,trips:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.trip_date)} · ${esc(r.start_location)} → ${esc(r.end_location)}</strong><p>${esc(r.driver_name||'Ukjent fører')} · ${esc(r.purpose||'Uten formål')}</p></div>${pill(r.status)}${pill(r.trip_type)}<small>${esc(r.distance_km||0)} km</small></article>`,maintenance:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.title)}</strong><p>${esc(r.registration)} · ${esc(r.vendor||'Leverandør ikke satt')}</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<small>Frist ${esc(r.due_date||'—')} · ${money(r.cost_minor)}</small></article>`,facilities:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.name)}</strong><p>${esc(r.address||'Adresse ikke satt')} · ${esc(r.owner_name||'Uten eier')}</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<small>FDV-objekt</small></article>`,projects:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.code)} · ${esc(r.name)}</strong><p>${esc(r.company_name||'Internt prosjekt')} · ${esc(r.billing_model||'')}</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<small>Budsjett ${money(r.budget_minor)}</small></article>`,rates:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.project_name)} · ${esc(r.role)}</strong><p>Pris ${money(r.hourly_minor)}/t · kostbasis ${money(r.cost_hourly_minor)}/t</p></div>${pill(r.source||'manual')}<small>Gyldig fra ${esc(r.valid_from||'—')}</small></article>`,time:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.work_date)} · ${esc(r.project_code)} · ${esc(r.person_name)}</strong><p>${esc(r.description||'Uten beskrivelse')} · ${r.billable?'Fakturerbar':'Ikke fakturerbar'}</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<small>${(Number(r.minutes||0)/60).toFixed(1)} t</small></article>`,wip:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.code)} · ${esc(r.name)}</strong><p>${esc(r.company_name||'Internt prosjekt')} · ${esc(r.entry_count||0)} godkjente fakturerbare timer</p></div><span><b>${money(r.amount_minor)}</b><small>kost ${money(r.cost_minor)} · margin ${money(Number(r.amount_minor||0)-Number(r.cost_minor||0))}</small></span></article>`,invoice_drafts:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.code)} · ${esc(r.period)} fakturautkast</strong><p>${esc(r.company_name||'Uten kunde')} · ${esc(r.source_minutes||0)} minutter fra timer</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<b>${money(r.amount_minor)}</b></article>`};
  const boardId = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('boardId') || 'board-1';
  async function get(view){const res=await fetch(`/api/field?boardId=${encodeURIComponent(boardId)}&view=${encodeURIComponent(view)}`);if(!res.ok)throw new Error('api');return res.json();}
  async function loadView(view){try{const data=await get(view);const rows=data.data||[];qs('#view-title').textContent=viewTitles[view]||view;list.innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(renderers[view]).join(''):'<p class="empty">Ingen registrerte rader.</p>';status.textContent=`${rows.length} poster · kilde synlig`;}catch{status.textContent='API utilgjengelig';list.innerHTML='<p class="empty">Kunne ikke hente registeret.</p>';}}
  async function loadSummary(){try{const d=(await get('summary')).data||{};qs('#m-fleet').textContent=d.fleet?.count??0;qs('#m-trips').textContent=d.trips?.count??0;qs('#m-wip').textContent=money(d.wip?.amount_minor);qs('#m-facilities').textContent=d.facilities?.count??0;qs('#hero-projects').textContent=d.projects?.count??0;qs('#hero-hours').textContent=`${(Number(d.time?.minutes||0)/60).toFixed(1)} timer i kø`;}catch{}}
  function setOptions(id,rows,empty,label){const el=qs(`#${id}`);el.innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(label).join(''):`<option value="">${empty}</option>`;}
  async function fillOptions(){try{const views=await Promise.all(['trips','maintenance','facility_tasks','projects','people','time','invoice_drafts'].map(get));const [trips,maint,tasks,projects,people,time,drafts]=views.map(x=>x.data||[]);const active=projects.filter(r=>r.status==='active');setOptions('trip-select',trips.filter(r=>r.status==='draft'),'Ingen turer til kontroll',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.trip_date)} · ${esc(r.start_location)} → ${esc(r.end_location)}</option>`);setOptions('maintenance-select',maint.filter(r=>['scheduled','booked','overdue'].includes(r.status)),'Ingen åpne oppgaver',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.registration)} · ${esc(r.title)}</option>`);setOptions('facility-task-select',tasks.filter(r=>['open','scheduled','overdue'].includes(r.status)),'Ingen åpne FDV-oppgaver',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.facility_name)} · ${esc(r.title)}</option>`);const projectOpt=r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.code)} · ${esc(r.name)}</option>`;setOptions('project-select',active,'Ingen aktive prosjekter',projectOpt);setOptions('time-entry-project-select',active,'Ingen aktive prosjekter',projectOpt);setOptions('time-entry-person-select',people,'Ingen aktive personer',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.name)} · ${esc(r.role||'')}</option>`);setOptions('time-draft-select',time.filter(r=>r.status==='draft'),'Ingen timeutkast',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.work_date)} · ${esc(r.project_code)} · ${esc(r.person_name)} · ${esc(r.minutes)} min</option>`);setOptions('time-select',time.filter(r=>r.status==='submitted'),'Ingen timer til kontroll',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.work_date)} · ${esc(r.project_code)} · ${esc(r.person_name)}</option>`);const draftOption=r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.code)} · ${esc(r.period)} · ${money(r.amount_minor)}</option>`;setOptions('draft-select',drafts.filter(r=>['prepared','review'].includes(r.status)),'Ingen utkast til kontroll',draftOption);setOptions('draft-convert-select',drafts.filter(r=>r.status==='approved'&&!String(r.external_reference||'').startsWith('sales_invoice:')),'Ingen godkjente utkast',draftOption);}catch{}}
  async function api(payload){const res=await fetch('/api/field',{method:'POST',headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({boardId,...payload})});const data=await res.json();if(!res.ok)throw new Error(data.error||'request_failed');return data;}
  async function refresh(){await Promise.all([loadSummary(),fillOptions(),loadView(document.querySelector('.tabs button.active')?.dataset.view||'fleet')]);}
  function bind(id,build){qs(`#${id}`).addEventListener('submit',async(e)=>{e.preventDefault();actionStatus.hidden=false;actionStatus.classList.remove('error');try{const result=await api(build(new FormData(e.currentTarget)));if(result.action==='convert_invoice_draft'&&result.invoiceId){actionStatus.innerHTML=`✓ Salgsfakturautkast ${esc(result.invoiceNumber||result.invoiceId)} er opprettet. <a href="/app/finance?boardId=${encodeURIComponent(boardId)}&invoiceId=${encodeURIComponent(result.invoiceId)}#daily-workflows">Åpne fakturaen i regnskapet ↗</a>`;}else{actionStatus.textContent='Endringen er lagret og auditert.';}await refresh();}catch(err){actionStatus.classList.add('error');actionStatus.textContent=err.message==='write_not_authorized'?'Du trenger eier- eller redaktørrolle.':'Handlingen kunne ikke lagres.';}});}
  bind('trip-form',f=>({action:'classify_trip',tripId:f.get('tripId'),tripType:f.get('tripType')}));bind('maintenance-form',f=>({action:'complete_maintenance',maintenanceId:f.get('maintenanceId')}));bind('facility-form',f=>({action:'complete_facility_task',taskId:f.get('taskId'),evidenceRef:f.get('evidenceRef')}));bind('time-entry-form',f=>({action:'create_time_entry',projectId:f.get('projectId'),personId:f.get('personId'),workDate:f.get('workDate'),minutes:f.get('minutes'),description:f.get('description'),billable:true}));bind('time-submit-form',f=>({action:'submit_time',entryId:f.get('entryId')}));bind('invoice-form',f=>({action:'prepare_invoice',projectId:f.get('projectId'),period:f.get('period')}));bind('time-approval-form',f=>({action:'approve_time',entryId:f.get('entryId')}));bind('draft-approval-form',f=>({action:'approve_invoice_draft',draftId:f.get('draftId')}));bind('draft-convert-form',f=>({action:'convert_invoice_draft',draftId:f.get('draftId'),issueDate:f.get('issueDate'),dueDate:f.get('dueDate'),invoiceNumber:f.get('invoiceNumber'),vatRate:f.get('vatRate')}));
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach((button)=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach((b)=>b.classList.remove('active'));button.classList.add('active');loadView(button.dataset.view);}));refresh();
</script>
<style>
  .field-shell{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:38px 24px 80px}.field-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .45fr;align-items:center;gap:24px;padding:44px;border-radius:27px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#263a43,#35707a);color:#fff}.eyebrow,.kicker{font:700 .68rem system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c5eee7}.field-hero h1{margin:20px 0 16px;font:500 clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.4rem)/.96 Georgia,serif}.field-hero h1 em{color:#c3f3bc;font-style:normal}.field-hero p{max-width:570px;color:#ffffffbf;font:1rem/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif}.primary{display:inline-flex;margin-top:22px;padding:13px 17px;border-radius:10px;background:#c8f4bf;color:#21413d;font:700 .78rem system-ui,sans-serif}.field-orb{width:190px;height:190px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid #c5eee7aa;border-radius:50%;background:#255763;color:#fff}.field-orb strong{font:500 3.2rem Georgia,serif;color:#d0ffc4}.field-orb span,.field-orb small{font:.68rem system-ui,sans-serif}.field-orb small{margin-top:9px;color:#b9dfdb}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin:16px 0 52px}.metrics article{min-height:105px;padding:17px;border:1px solid #10241f14;border-radius:15px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.metrics .dark{background:#10241f;color:#fff}.metrics span,.metrics small{color:#718078;font:600 .67rem system-ui,sans-serif}.metrics strong{font:500 1.7rem Georgia,serif}.metrics small{color:#478f68}.workspace{padding:28px;border:1px solid #10241f18;border-radius:20px;background:#fff}.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end}.head h2{margin:9px 0 0;font:500 2.1rem Georgia,serif}.head>span{color:#718078;font:.7rem system-ui,sans-serif}.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;overflow:auto;margin:25px 0 12px}.tabs button{padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #10241f1c;border-radius:9px;background:#fafbf9;color:#65746b;cursor:pointer;font:700 .72rem system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap}.tabs button.active{background:#255763;color:#fff}.workspace article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr auto auto;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:15px 4px;border-top:1px solid #10241f12}.workspace strong{font:600 .82rem system-ui,sans-serif}.workspace p,.workspace small{margin:5px 0 0;color:#718078;font:.7rem/1.35 system-ui,sans-serif}.pill{padding:5px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#e9f3f5;color:#286977;font:700 .61rem system-ui,sans-serif;font-style:normal;white-space:nowrap}.actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:28px;margin-top:35px;padding:24px;border:1px solid #10241f18;border-radius:18px;background:#edf5f3}.actions h2{margin:9px 0 7px;font:500 1.8rem Georgia,serif}.actions p{color:#63736a;font:.78rem/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.action-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}.action-grid form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;padding:15px;border:1px solid #10241f18;border-radius:13px;background:#fff}.action-grid strong{font:700 .78rem system-ui,sans-serif}.action-grid label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;color:#718078;font:600 .62rem system-ui,sans-serif}.action-grid input,.action-grid select{width:100%;padding:8px;border:1px solid #10241f26;border-radius:8px;background:#fbfdfb;font:.71rem system-ui,sans-serif}.action-grid button{margin-top:auto;padding:9px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#255763;color:#fff;font:700 .67rem system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.action-grid small{color:#718078;font:.66rem/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif}.form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7px}.action-status{grid-column:1/-1;min-height:1.2em;margin:0;color:#286977;font:700 .72rem system-ui,sans-serif}.action-status.error{color:#a33f35}.notice{margin-top:35px;padding:22px 25px;border-radius:16px;background:#edf5f3}.notice strong{font:700 .78rem system-ui,sans-serif}.notice p{margin:8px 0 0;color:#63736a;font:.78rem/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}@media(max-width:800px){.field-hero,.actions{grid-template-columns:1fr}.metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:560px){.field-shell{padding:20px 15px 55px}.field-hero{padding:28px 22px}.metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr}.workspace{padding:20px 16px}.head{align-items:start;flex-direction:column;gap:9px}.workspace article{grid-template-columns:1fr auto}.workspace article small{grid-column:1}.action-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
